[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18180.55, "timestamp": "05:03:00", "text": "为什么？哦不，我们被暗杀了。那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18184.55, "timestamp": "05:03:04", "text": "真糟糕。不要告诉你你的规则。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18186.07, "timestamp": "05:03:06", "text": "把你的规则大声说出来。我只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18188.39, "timestamp": "05:03:08", "text": "说道。哦不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18191.11, "timestamp": "05:03:11", "text": "那不是我。我向你保证。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18193.91, "timestamp": "05:03:13", "text": "所以传感器可以利用你的传感器来观察。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18196.788, "timestamp": "05:03:16", "text": "尸体所在位置。是的，这很有帮助。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18201.35, "timestamp": "05:03:21", "text": "你发现了尸体。我们得到了三个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18214.47, "timestamp": "05:03:34", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18218.628, "timestamp": "05:03:38", "text": "真可爱。可爱的。可爱的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18220.948, "timestamp": "05:03:40", "text": "但你不一样。你杀了我。什么？我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18223.91, "timestamp": "05:03:43", "text": "对不起。 T：可是你是怎么知道的呢？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18226.15, "timestamp": "05:03:46", "text": "需要了解。我上次没听到你说话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18228.23, "timestamp": "05:03:48", "text": "前。如何？如何？现在就告诉我。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18231.27, "timestamp": "05:03:51", "text": "因为呃，你现在被静音了，而且你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18234.15, "timestamp": "05:03:54", "text": "向下移动。所以你当时没有回复"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18236.628, "timestamp": "05:03:56", "text": "我跟他打了声招呼。所以我就想，等等，为什么会这样？"}]